{"step_index":169,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:49:56Z","content":"I have updated the browser tab icon (**favicon**) to use the official StreamWave company logo.\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Updates Applied\n\n1. **Favicon Assets Created**:\n   - Generated [`public/images/favicon.png`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/images/favicon.png) and [`public/favicon.ico`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/favicon.ico) from the official StreamWave logo.\n2. **HTML Head Metadata**:\n   - Added `<link rel=\"icon\">`, `<link rel=\"shortcut icon\">`, and `<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\">` tags in [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html).\n\nYour browser tabs will now render the official StreamWave red play/wave icon instead of the default globe icon!"}
{"step_index":170,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:53:38Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nLETS also have a landing page similar to netflix one which will allow users to either login or get started with the name of the streaming company \n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-25T20:53:38+02:00.\n\nThe user has uploaded 1 image(s):\n- C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/.user_uploaded/media_1787683967196.png\nYou can embed this image in an artifact if you need the USER to review it.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":171,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:53:38Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Landing Page Design**\n\nI'm currently focused on the Netflix landing page design. I'm examining its structure, especially the call to action for login or signup. My aim is to extract the key elements that contribute to its effectiveness, and I'm planning to use these to create a similar landing page, while making the needed tweaks.\n\n\n**Reviewing Landing Page Structure**\n\nI've moved on to examining the StreamWave landing page. I've dissected the design into key components, specifically focusing on the header with its logo and \"Sign In\" button. I'm taking notes on the hero background, content (headline, subheading, and call to action), and the email input. I've also noted how the \"Get Started\" prompt integrates with the overall flow.\n\n\n**Implementing Hero Landing Section**\n\nI'm now integrating a dedicated Netflix-style hero landing section at the top, complete with top navigation (logo and \"Sign In\" button), overlay content (title, subtitle, and call-to-action form). The \"Sign In\" button will trigger an accessible sign-in demo modal, and the form will handle email input and a \"Get Started\" button. I'm focusing on responsiveness and user-friendliness for this section.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Entertainment | Unlimited Movies & Music</title>\n    \n    <!-- Favicon Links for Browser Tab Logo Icon -->\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"#landing\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"brand-logo-img\">\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#catalogue\" class=\"nav-link\">Catalogue</a>\n                <a href=\"/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"nav-link developer-link\" title=\"Open API Documentation in Swagger\">\n                    Developer <span class=\"ext-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n                </a>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-signin-nav\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.openAuthModal()\">Sign In</button>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n        <!-- Netflix-Style Landing Hero Section -->\n        <section id=\"landing\" class=\"landing-hero\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Landing Page\">\n            <div class=\"landing-backdrop\"></div>\n            <div class=\"landing-content\">\n                <div class=\"serverless-pill\">\n                    <span class=\"pulse-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span>Serverless Academic Prototype</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"landing-title\">Unlimited Zimbabwean movies, music, and more</h1>\n                <p class=\"landing-subtitle\">Stream anywhere. Serverless performance. Cancel anytime.</p>\n                <p class=\"landing-prompt\">Ready to watch? Enter your email to get started or explore the catalogue.</p>\n\n                <form class=\"landing-email-form\" onsubmit=\"window.streamWaveApp.handleGetStarted(event)\">\n                    <input type=\"email\" id=\"landing-email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required aria-label=\"Email address for membership\">\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-get-started\">\n                        Get Started <span class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Featured Media Release Showcase -->\n        <section id=\"featured\" class=\"hero-section\" aria-label=\"Featured Media Release\">\n            <div class=\"hero-backdrop\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-tag-group\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-tag\">FEATURED ZIMBABWEAN RELEASE</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">5-second technical preview</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\" title=\"Cook Off (2017)\">Cook Off</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>2017</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>Comedy / Romance</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>1h 41m</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">\n                    An uplifting Zimbabwean romantic comedy following Anesu, a single mother in Harare who enters a high-stakes national cooking competition against all odds.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.playMoviePreview('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▶</span> Watch\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.openDetails('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ</span> View Details\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Catalogue Filter & Search Section -->\n        <section id=\"catalogue\" class=\"catalogue-section\" aria-label=\"Media Catalogue\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Media Catalogue</h2>\n                <span class=\"item-count\" id=\"item-count\">Loading...</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Controls Toolbar -->\n            <div class=\"toolbar\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Catalogue Search and Filtering Controls\">\n                <div class=\"search-box\">\n                    <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</span>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-input\" placeholder=\"Search title, artist, director, or genre...\" aria-label=\"Search media catalogue\">\n                    <button id=\"clear-search\" class=\"clear-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear search query\" style=\"display: none;\">✕</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"filter-group\">\n                    <!-- Type Filter Tabs -->\n                    <div class=\"type-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter media by type\">\n                        <button class=\"type-tab active\" data-type=\"\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">All</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"movie\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Movies</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"music\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Music</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Genre Dropdown -->\n                    <div class=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select id=\"genre-select\" aria-label=\"Filter media by genre\">\n                            <option value=\"\">All Genres</option>\n                            <option value=\"Comedy\">Comedy</option>\n                            <option value=\"Drama\">Drama</option>\n                            <option value=\"Action\">Action</option>\n                            <option value=\"Zimdancehall\">Zimdancehall</option>\n                            <option value=\"Afro-pop\">Afro-pop</option>\n                            <option value=\"Traditional\">Traditional</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- UI States Container -->\n            <div id=\"state-container\">\n                <!-- Loading State -->\n                <div id=\"loading-state\" class=\"state-view\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading content\"></div>\n                    <p>Loading Zimbabwean media catalogue...</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Error State -->\n                <div id=\"error-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</div>\n                    <h3>Failed to Load Media</h3>\n                    <p id=\"error-message\">Unable to fetch media catalogue from serverless backend.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.fetchMedia()\">Try Again</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty State -->\n                <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</div>\n                    <h3>No Media Found</h3>\n                    <p>No titles match your current search and filter criteria.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.resetFilters()\">Reset Filters</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Media Cards Grid -->\n                <div id=\"media-grid\" class=\"media-grid\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Statement for Academic & Content Clarity -->\n    <footer class=\"app-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"footer-logo-img\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n                <strong>Non-Commercial Academic Prototype</strong> • Built with Python 3.12, FastAPI, and Vercel Serverless Functions.\n                Media titles and metadata are presented for Zimbabwean cultural demonstration purposes. Movie previews use an original 5-second StreamWave MP4 video. Audio playback relies on an original synthesized demonstration chime. No copyrighted commercial files are hosted or transmitted.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Netflix-Style Sign In Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"auth-dialog\" class=\"auth-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"auth-modal-title\">\n        <div class=\"auth-dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-auth-x\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close sign in modal\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.closeAuthModal()\">✕</button>\n            <div class=\"auth-header\">\n                <h2 id=\"auth-modal-title\" class=\"auth-title\">Sign In to StreamWave</h2>\n            </div>\n            <form class=\"auth-form\" onsubmit=\"window.streamWaveApp.handleSignIn(event)\">\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <input type=\"email\" id=\"auth-email\" placeholder=\"Email or phone number\" required aria-label=\"Email or phone number\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <input type=\"password\" id=\"auth-password\" placeholder=\"Password\" required aria-label=\"Password\">\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-auth-submit\">Sign In</button>\n                <div class=\"auth-help\">\n                    <label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Remember me</label>\n                    <a href=\"#catalogue\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.closeAuthModal()\">Need help?</a>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"auth-demo-note\">\n                    Demo Sign In Mode: Enter any test credentials to explore the platform catalogue.\n                </p>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-- Accessible Media Details Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"details-dialog\" class=\"details-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"dialog-desc\">\n        <div class=\"dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-dialog\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close details modal\">✕</button>\n            <div id=\"dialog-body\" class=\"dialog-body\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Content Injected via JS -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-- Professional Dedicated Video Player Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"video-dialog\" class=\"video-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"video-modal-title\">\n        <div class=\"video-dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-video-x\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close video preview modal\">✕</button>\n            <div class=\"video-modal-header\">\n                <div class=\"video-header-top\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie Preview</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">5-second technical preview</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 id=\"video-modal-title\" class=\"video-modal-title\">Movie Title</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"video-wrapper\">\n                <video id=\"html5-video\" controls playsinline preload=\"metadata\">\n                    <source id=\"video-source\" src=\"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n                    Your browser does not support HTML5 video playback.\n                </video>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"video-modal-footer\">\n                <button id=\"video-replay-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: none;\" aria-label=\"Replay video preview\">\n                    🔄 Replay\n                </button>\n                <button id=\"close-video-btn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" aria-label=\"Close video player modal\">\n                    Close\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-- Fixed HTML5 Audio Player Bar for Music Items -->\n    <aside id=\"audio-player-bar\" class=\"audio-player-bar\" aria-label=\"Audio Player Controls\">\n        <div class=\"player-container\">\n            <button id=\"player-toggle-btn\" class=\"player-toggle-btn\" aria-label=\"Minimize audio player\" title=\"Minimize player\">▼</button>\n            \n            <div class=\"player-track-info\">\n                <div class=\"track-thumb\" id=\"player-thumb\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎵</div>\n                <div class=\"track-text\">\n                    <div class=\"track-title\" id=\"player-title\">Select a track to play</div>\n                    <div class=\"track-artist\" id=\"player-artist\">StreamWave Audio Player</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"player-controls\">\n                <audio id=\"html5-audio\" controls preload=\"metadata\" aria-label=\"Media Audio Player\">\n                    <source id=\"audio-source\" src=\"\" type=\"audio/wav\">\n                    Your browser does not support HTML5 audio playback.\n                </audio>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"player-status\" id=\"event-log-badge\">\n                <span class=\"event-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span id=\"event-log-text\">Ready</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <script src=\"/js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Add Netflix-style landing hero section, email form, and Sign In modal in public/index.html","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\public\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating public/index.html with Netflix landing page","toolSummary":"Updating public/index.html with Netflix landing page"}}]}
