{"step_index":173,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:54:09Z","thinking":"**Implementing CSS Changes**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the Netflix-style landing hero in `public/css/styles.css`. This includes adding styles for the hero section itself, the email form, button chevrons, and the sign-in modal. Currently, I'm working through the necessary CSS rules to achieve the desired visual look and feel, aiming for a clean and user-friendly design.\n\n\n**Refining Hero Styling**\n\nI've been honing the hero section's visual design. I am using `public/css/styles.css`, and I am working on the background styling, including the radial and linear gradients, and ensuring the image and backdrop elements work together cohesively. I'm focusing on text alignment and overall layout within the hero component now.\n\n\n**Styling Form and Buttons**\n\nNow, I'm focusing on refining the styles of form elements and buttons within the hero section. I've been incorporating styles for the email form, the \"Get Started\" button (including its chevron), and the sign-in navigation button. I'm paying careful attention to font sizes, weights, padding, colors, and border radii for a cohesive and intuitive user experience. I've also begun to sketch out the styling for the auth dialog.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --bg-base: #121214;\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\n    \n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\n\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\n\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\n\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\n    --radius-md: 6px;\n    \n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n}\n\n/* Base Resets */\n*, *::before, *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\n}\n\nbody {\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures footer */\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n}\n\na {\n    color: inherit;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nbutton, input, select {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: inherit;\n}\n\n/* Accessibility Focus Visible */\n*:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-red);\n    outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* Reduced Motion */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    }\n}\n\n/* Navigation Bar */\n.navbar {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.nav-container {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.brand {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.brand-logo-img {\n    height: 48px;\n    max-height: 52px;\n    width: auto;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    display: block;\n    transition: transform 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.brand-logo-img:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n}\n\n.footer-logo-img {\n    height: 36px;\n    width: auto;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.logo-symbol {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.logo-accent {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.875rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    transition: color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.developer-link {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.3);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.developer-link:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.25);\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-signin-nav {\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.ext-icon {\n    font-size: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n/* Main Container */\n.main-content {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n/* Netflix-Style Landing Hero Section */\n.landing-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 5.5rem 1.5rem;\n    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    background-color: #0b0b0d;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.18) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.96) 75%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574375927938-d5a98e8ffe85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80');\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 120px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);\n}\n\n.landing-backdrop {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.82) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.65) 50%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.98) 100%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.landing-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    max-width: 820px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.15rem;\n}\n\n.serverless-pill {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 28, 0.92);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-size: 0.725rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.landing-title {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.landing-subtitle {\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.landing-prompt {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    margin-top: 0.15rem;\n}\n\n.landing-email-form {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 620px;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    margin-top: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.landing-email-form input {\n    flex: 1;\n    background-color: rgba(22, 22, 26, 0.9);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    outline: none;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.landing-email-form input:focus {\n    border-color: var(--accent-red);\n}\n\n.btn-get-started {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.btn-get-started .chevron {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    margin-left: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n/* Hero / Featured Section */\n.hero-section {\n    position: relative;\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;\n    margin-bottom: 2rem;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(24, 24, 28, 0.95) 45%, rgba(24, 24, 28, 0.65)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555396273-367ea4eb4db5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    max-width: 620px;\n}\n\n.hero-tag-group {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.6rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.hero-tag {\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    font-size: 0.725rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.tech-sample-pill {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.675rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n    font-size: 2.25rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n}\n\n.hero-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.meta-tag {\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-size: 0.725rem;\n}\n\n.meta-separator {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.hero-description {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 0.925rem;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n}\n\n.hero-action